&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core thesis&lt;/strong&gt;: Once AI can write code, the bottleneck is no longer &amp;ldquo;can it produce a patch?&amp;rdquo; — it&amp;rsquo;s &amp;ldquo;can the system prove that patch should be accepted?&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
